ApplyWise – Career Application Tracking & Analytics Portal
📌 Overview

ApplyWise is a web-based Career Application Tracking & Analytics Portal designed to help job seekers organize, monitor, and analyze their job applications in one place.

The project combines a clean user interface with application tracking, analytics, and actionable insights to make the job-search process more structured and data-driven.

🎯 Objectives
Track job applications efficiently
Monitor application progress and statuses
View important application metrics
Analyze job-search performance
Provide insights to improve the application strategy
Create a simple and user-friendly career management experience
✨ Features
📊 Analytics Dashboard – View key metrics such as applications, interviews, and offers
📝 Application Tracker – Keep track of job applications and their current status
📈 Application Analytics – Understand application trends and performance
💡 Insights & Recommendations – Get actionable suggestions based on application activity
🎨 Responsive UI – Clean and modern interface designed for easy navigation
🔗 Portfolio Integration – Built as a practical project for demonstrating web development and analytics skills
🛠️ Technologies Used
HTML5 – Page structure
CSS3 – Styling and responsive design
JavaScript – Interactivity and application logic
Git & GitHub – Version control and project hosting
📂 Project Structure
ApplyWise/
│
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── script.js
│
├── images/
│   ├── Homepage.png
│   ├── Dashboard.png
│   ├── Tracker.png
│   ├── Analytics.png
│   ├── Insights.png
│   └── About.png
│
└── README.md
🚀 How to Run
Clone the repository:
git clone https://github.com/panimayapreethi/ApplyWise.git
Open the project folder.
Open index.html in your browser.

No additional installation or dependencies are required.

💡 What I Learned

Through this project, I strengthened my understanding of:

Front-end web development
JavaScript-based interactivity
Dashboard and UI design
Data-driven decision making
User experience design
Git and GitHub project management
🔮 Future Improvements

Some planned improvements include:

User authentication
Database integration
Real-time application tracking
Advanced analytics
Job search API integration
Automated application reminders
AI-powered career recommendations
